### Probar con la extensión "REST Client" de VS Code (botón "Send Request" sobre cada pedido).
### Requiere `npm run dev` con todos los servicios y los seeds cargados.
### Ojo con las reglas anti-trampa: 2 s entre crear la sesión y el primer acierto, 1 s entre intentos.
@gateway = http://localhost:3000
@gameplay = http://localhost:3003
@internalToken = dev-internal-token-deventure
@firstLevel = 11000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101
@secondLevel = 11000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102
@firstChallenge = 12000000-0000-4000-8000-000000010101
@secondChallenge = 12000000-0000-4000-8000-000000010102

### Registrar un jugador nuevo (solo tiene desbloqueado el nivel 1)
# @name register
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "vikingo_{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}",
  "email": "vikingo{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}@deventure.dev",
  "password": "Clave1234"
}

### Nivel 2 todavía bloqueado → 403 LEVEL_LOCKED
POST {{gateway}}/api/gameplay/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{register.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "levelId": "{{secondLevel}}" }

### Empezar el nivel 1 → 201 (3 vidas, desafío 0)
# @name session
POST {{gateway}}/api/gameplay/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{register.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "levelId": "{{firstLevel}}" }

### Estado de la sesión → 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/gameplay/sessions/{{session.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{register.response.body.data.token}}

### Pedir una pista (no resta vidas) → 200 { order, text, remaining }
POST {{gateway}}/api/gameplay/sessions/{{session.response.body.data.id}}/hints
Authorization: Bearer {{register.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "challengeId": "{{firstChallenge}}" }

### Respuesta incorrecta → correct false, livesLeft 2, mensaje del error común
POST {{gateway}}/api/gameplay/sessions/{{session.response.body.data.id}}/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{register.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "challengeId": "{{firstChallenge}}", "answer": { "type": "multiple_choice", "optionId": "screen" } }

### Desafío que no es el actual → 400 CHALLENGE_MISMATCH
POST {{gateway}}/api/gameplay/sessions/{{session.response.body.data.id}}/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{register.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "challengeId": "{{secondChallenge}}", "answer": { "type": "order_blocks", "order": ["k", "r", "b"] } }

### Respuesta correcta → correct true, explicación, nextIndex 1
POST {{gateway}}/api/gameplay/sessions/{{session.response.body.data.id}}/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{register.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "challengeId": "{{firstChallenge}}", "answer": { "type": "multiple_choice", "optionId": "instructions" } }

### Ordenar bloques correctamente
POST {{gateway}}/api/gameplay/sessions/{{session.response.body.data.id}}/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{register.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "challengeId": "{{secondChallenge}}", "answer": { "type": "order_blocks", "order": ["k", "r", "b"] } }

### Desafío 3 (opción múltiple)
POST {{gateway}}/api/gameplay/sessions/{{session.response.body.data.id}}/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{register.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "challengeId": "12000000-0000-4000-8000-000000010103", "answer": { "type": "multiple_choice", "optionId": "different" } }

### Último desafío (¿qué imprime?) → sessionStatus won + result, desbloqueos y recompensas
POST {{gateway}}/api/gameplay/sessions/{{session.response.body.data.id}}/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{register.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "challengeId": "12000000-0000-4000-8000-000000010104", "answer": { "type": "predict_output", "output": "Hola\nvikingo" } }

### Sesión terminada → 409 SESSION_CLOSED
POST {{gateway}}/api/gameplay/sessions/{{session.response.body.data.id}}/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{register.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "challengeId": "{{firstChallenge}}", "answer": { "type": "multiple_choice", "optionId": "instructions" } }

### Abandonar una sesión (PATCH sobre el recurso) → 200 status abandoned
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/gameplay/sessions/{{session.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{register.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "abandoned" }

### Probar un validador sin jugar (interno, lo usa la vista previa del admin)
POST {{gameplay}}/internal/validations
x-internal-token: {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "challenge": {
    "type": "fill_code",
    "language": "sql",
    "payload": { "mode": "free", "starterCode": "" },
    "solution": { "accepted": ["SELECT nombre FROM vikingos WHERE edad > 30;"] },
    "commonErrors": []
  },
  "answer": { "type": "fill_code", "code": "select nombre from vikingos where edad>30" }
}
